sf 20 25
s 110 20
tick 300
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@20:25.000
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@110:20.000 ESCALATE@110:20.000
NORMAL

